  "title": "AECOM appointed lead design consultant for the New Richmond Bridge, Stage 2",
  "summary": "SYDNEY (July 20, 2026) — AECOM, the trusted global infrastructure leader, today announced its appointment as the lead design consultant for Stage 2 of the New Richmond Bridge project, supporting Transport for New South Wales and the lead contractor, Fulton Hogan. The partnership will design and deliver a new, taller flood-resilient bridge over the Hawkesbury River at North Richmond, maintaining community connectivity during flooding events. “We see bridges as more than transport infrastructure — they are enduring structures of...",
